":"ராகலிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"றம்மின்","parts":[{"text":"றம்மின்","lemma":"றம்மின்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"றிமைப்புவரை","parts":[{"text":"றிமைப்புவரை","lemma":"இமைப்புவரை","gloss":"even for the duration of a blink"}],"gloss":"even for the duration of a blink"},{"surface":"அமையா","parts":[{"text":"அமை","lemma":"அமை","gloss":"to abide/stay"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"not"}],"gloss":"not staying"},{"surface":"நம்வயின்","parts":[{"text":"நம்","lemma":"நம்","gloss":"our"},{"text":"வயின்","lemma":"வயின்","gloss":"side/place"}],"gloss":"at our side"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மறந்து","parts":[{"text":"மறந்து","lemma":"மறந்து","gloss":"having forgotten"}],"gloss":"having forgotten"},{"surface":"ஆண்டு","parts":[{"text":"ஆண்டு","lemma":"ஆண்டு","gloss":"there"}],"gloss":"there"},{"surface":"அமைதல்","parts":[{"text":"அமைதல்","lemma":"அமைதல்","gloss":"staying"}],"gloss":"staying"},{"surface":"வல்லியோர்","parts":[{"text":"வல்லி","lemma":"வல்லி","gloss":"strong/capable person"},{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"plural suffix"}],"gloss":"those who are strong-hearted"},{"surface":"மாட்டே","parts":[{"text":"மாட்டு","lemma":"மாட்டு","gloss":"with/towards"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"only with them"}]}],"literal":"In the mountain range with caves, to the powerful goddess with the trident / we will not undertake vows, we will not tie the protective hand-thread / we will not examine the birds, we will not stand waiting for the voice of omen / we will not even think of doing so, O friend! / Because he is like life to our life, more than himself / not staying even for the duration of a blink at our side / his staying there having forgotten us is only possible for those who are strong-hearted.","translation":"O friend! We will not make vows to the powerful goddess of the mountain caves, nor will we tie the protective thread on our hands. We will not consult the birds for omens, nor will we wait for the voice of good fortune. We will not even think of doing such things! Because he is like life to our life, and could not stay away from us even for the blink of an eye. If he can now forget us and stay there in that wasteland, it is only because he is strong-hearted.","modern":"தோழியே! மலைக்குகைகள் நிறைந்த மலையடுக்கில் வாழும் வெற்றி பொருந்திய சூலமேந்திய கொற்றவைக்கு நாம் நேர்த்திக்கடன் செலுத்த மாட்டோம்; கையில் காப்பு நாணும் கட்ட மாட்டோம். பறவைகளின் சகுனம் பார்க்க மாட்டோம்; விரிச்சி கேட்டு நிற்கவும் மாட்டோம். இவற்றைப்பற்றி நாம் நினைக்கவும் மாட்டோம். ஏனெனில், அவர் நம் உயிருக்கு உயிரானவர்; நம்மை விட்டு ஒரு கண் இமைக்கும் நேரம்கூட பிரியாமல் இருந்தவர். அப்படிப்பட்டவர் நம்மை மறந்துவிட்டு அந்தப் பாலைவனத்தில் தங்கியிருக்க முடிகிறது என்றால், அது போன்ற வன்னெஞ்சம் படைத்தவர்களால்தான் அது இயலும்.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her confidante in the Pālai (wasteland) landscape. Her lover has departed on a journey through the harsh desert to earn wealth, leaving her in deep grief. The foster-mother or others suggest performing rituals, making vows to the goddess Koṟṟavai, tying protective threads, or seeking omens to ensure his safe return and ease her suffering. The heroine rejects all these rituals, declaring that they will not perform any of them. She explains that her lover is so close to her that he is like life to her life, and he used to be unable to leave her side even for the blink of an eye. Since he has now managed to forget her and stay away in the distant land, she concludes that he must have a very strong, unyielding heart, and no rituals can change that.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.72,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.7,2.03],[2.1,3.3],[3.3,3.33],[3.33,3.5],[3.77,4.3],[4.3,5.4],[5.4,5.5],[5.5,6.25],[6.54,6.8],[6.8,7.55],[7.8,8.2],[8.2,8.4],[8.4,8.7],[8.7,9.5],[9.5,9.5],[9.5,9.57],[9.63,11.1],[11.41,12.5],[12.5,12.9],[12.9,13.0],[13.0,14.3],[14.37,14.7],[14.7,15.1],[15.1,15.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.94,1.3],[1.3,1.9],[2.1,2.18],[2.18,2.19],[2.19,2.19],[2.19,2.19],[2.19,2.2],[2.2,5.9],[5.9,6.0],[6.0,6.73],[6.82,7.0],[7.0,8.2],[8.2,8.2],[8.2,9.1],[9.1,9.2],[9.2,10.66],[10.78,10.9],[10.9,11.38],[11.38,12.7],[12.7,13.3],[13.4,13.8],[13.8,14.5],[14.5,15.5],[15.58,16.0],[16.0,16.5],[16.5,16.7]]}}